// title: MDA   File Download by Country
// date: 2026-10-21
// product: Defender for Cloud Apps
// tables: CloudAppEvents
// purpose: MDA File Download by Country
// source: https://github.com/jkerai1/KQL-Queries/blob/829b34aea9fce1b50995ff348ee7be6b8eca34f3/Defender/MDA%20-%20File%20Download%20by%20Country.kql
